{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08554","headline":"詶裴侍御对雨感时见赠 · 李白","name":"詶裴侍御对雨感时见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨色秋来寒，风严清江爽。\n孤高绣衣人，潇洒青霞赏。\n平生多感激，忠义非外奖。\n祸连积怨生，事及徂川往。\n楚邦有壮士，鄢郢翻扫荡。\n申包哭秦庭，泣血将安仰。\n鞭屍辱已及，堂上罗宿莽。\n颇似今之人，蟊贼陷忠谠。\n渺然一水隔，何由税归鞅。\n日夕听猨怨，怀贤盈梦想。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}